Applying the infinitesimal propagator to a state gives $\ket{\psi(\epsilon)}
=\ket{\psi(0)}-i\epsilon H\ket{\psi(0)}+O(\epsilon^2).$ Rearranging produces the difference quotient displayed on the board: $\frac{\ket{\psi(\epsilon)}-\ket{\psi(0)}}{\epsilon}
=-iH\ket{\psi(0)}+O(\epsilon).$

